{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09211","headline":"荅库部韩郎中 · 韦应物","name":"荅库部韩郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高士不羁世，颇将荣辱齐。\n适委华冕去，欲还幽林栖。\n虽怀承明恋，忻与物累暌。\n逍遥观运流，谁复职端倪。\n而我岂高致，偃息平门西。\n愚者世所遗，沮溺共耕犂。\n风雪积深夜，园田掩荒蹊。\n幸蒙相思札，款曲期见携。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}